```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you both. This is very helpful. Jon, I want to see that completed lab work formally — please get it attached to the production traveler so it's on the record. I also need your recommendation on an acceptable blend ratio and how many initial molded samples we'd need for identity testing. Priya, the revised SDS and the regulated-waste classification are critical. Before I can even consider authorizing this material, the chemical register needs to be updated with that revised SDS, and we need labeled segregated storage and a hazardous-waste manifest in place for any discarded pellets or purge material from this lot. So here's where I stand: I am not authorizing the reclaimed lot yet. There are too many open items — lab data not yet formally on the traveler, no blend ratio established, no identity testing plan confirmed, the SDS not entered in the chemical register, and no segregated storage or waste manifest set up. I need both of you to close those gaps and report back to me before I make a final decision. If we can't get all of this resolved and documented before Thursday, we may need to delay the run or source additional virgin polymer. Let's move quickly but correctly on this."}
```

